# Got Moles route engine — credentials
# Copy to `.env` in THIS folder (the bundle root). Every script resolves it by walking up from
# its own location, so it must sit here, beside README.md — not inside projects/.
#
# Nothing in this bundle contains a live credential. All four values below are required.

# --- Jobber (source of truth for jobs, visits, assignees) -------------------
# A Jobber app under Developer Center. The refresh token is obtained once via
# `node .claude/skills/tool-jobber/scripts/jobber-api.mjs auth`, which runs a browser
# flow on http://localhost:8734/callback and writes the token back into .env.
# NOTE the scripts ROTATE this value in place: Jobber hands back a new refresh token on
# some refreshes and the client rewrites .env. Do not manage .env from config control.
JOBBER_CLIENT_ID=
JOBBER_CLIENT_SECRET=
JOBBER_REFRESH_TOKEN=

# --- OptimoRoute (the solver: orders, planning, routes) ---------------------
# One account-wide key. Planning API.
OPTIMOROUTE_API_KEY=
